<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Proof of payment and policy validity dates that align with the shipping schedule.</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Providing a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance not only satisfies regulatory demands but also offers peace of mind for both the owner and the transport company. It ensures that in the event of an incident, compensation will match the full market value of the vehicle, thereby protecting the owner’s investment.</p>
